    "format-version": "0.1",
    "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
    "name": "ATAC-seq GTN",
    "readme": "Bulk ATAC-seq analysis workflow used in https://gxy.io/GTN:T00137. It works with a subsampled Human hg38, chr22 dataset. \n\n**Inputs**\n- Paired collection of an ATAC FASTQ file, subsampled to only reads from chr22\n- DNA binding sitess of CTCF as narrowPeak file, downloaded from ENCODE\n- Gene annotation on chr22 extracted from UCSC table browser.\n\n**Outputs**\n- Predicted open chromatin regions\n- A heatmaps of those regions on chr22 around TSS and known CTCF peaks\n- Visual representation known CTCF peaks over predicted open chromatin regions on a genome browser      ",
    "report": {
        "markdown": "\n# Workflow Execution Report\n\n## Workflow Inputs\n```galaxy\ninvocation_inputs()\n```\n\n## Workflow Outputs\n```galaxy\ninvocation_outputs()\n```\n\n## Workflow\n```galaxy\nworkflow_display()\n```\n"
    },
